  "$description": "Špijun design tokens (W3C DTCG format). Source: claude.ai Design canvas 'Špijun — Design' (Phase 2 boards 03–06, 10; Phase 4 H·01, H·05). Maps 1:1 to the Compose theme SpyTheme { SpyColors, SpyType, SpyShape, SpySpace, SpyMotion, SpyHaptics }. Units: px == pt on iOS == dp on Android; font sizes px == pt/sp. Dynamic colour (Material You) is OFF.",
